IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `wa-interpretation-s5-definitions`

-- Tests for wa-interpretation-s5-definitions.l4.  One group per defined term.  The way each term is defined is classified here
-- by a separate regular expression run over the raw text (generated), not copied from the module's table, so a wrong row shows
-- as a failing assertion.  The hand-written tests for the terms that matter most to a reader are in wa-tests-s5-key-terms.l4.

